  "note": "Full unchanged measured source-index geometry, not independent surveys/accuracy ground truth. Full-input production TIN records XY duplicates and automatic edge rejection; no generated/transformed/thinned performance coordinates. Independent archived retained-CPU worker supplies full f32 distance, exact f64 summary and scalar PLY oracles, then terminates before timing. Both builds already adopt cached traversal bounds and the same 1 GiB mesh/BVH policy, resident workers, logical slices, geometry capacities and reservations. Candidate retains content-matched original f64 query points and exact preceding Morton orders, not results or guessed triangles. Maximum eight sets and 8 MiB boxed payload per pool worker, at most 64 MiB across the eight-lane pool; real retained payload is 28 bytes per queried point. Full f64 bit comparison rejects coordinate/order changes, signed-zero changes and NaN-payload changes. Hits still copy incoming queries, reset guess/stack and execute all searches/signed arithmetic. Misses evict oldest payload to stay within allowance; oversized/empty inputs and disabled/hinted controls clear and calculate normally. Source edits/removal queue order release on live workers. Geometry and order allowances are separate; observed per-lane maxima are diagnostics, not process peak memory. One excluded first pair, five alternating warm-up pairs and ten alternating timed pairs compare separate archived/current production contexts. Timed geometry/order misses, fallback, layout/budget mismatch or output differences fail. Whole unsigned RPC includes copying, full matching/order when needed, queries/join/summary/arrays. Loading/meshing/startup/first observations/warmups/export/parity/cleanup excluded. Eleven source files, script/artifacts/inputs/manifest/original PCD checked before/after. No builds/tests/scans/edits alongside timing. All losses/spikes retained; clocks/power/scheduling/GC/other apps/code layout/pages uncontrolled. No isolated order/native/signed/GPU timing claim. No GPU dispatch/model identifiers collected."
